      "blockers": [
        "gained-ability name rewriting, copied abilities, and text-changing effects are not represented by this compiler-only source-reference family",
        "name changes after compilation and name references to objects other than the source require separate typed identity and effect contracts"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "A recognized source name lowers to existing source identity; fixed newly recognized self modifiers use $source.zone_object. Runtime handlers never compare a printed card name.",
        "Pinned War Machine Oracle: attacking with one War Machine offers up to one legal creature target and taps the chosen creature; an idle same-name permanent does not trigger. Targets are chosen at trigger placement, before resolution, under CR 603.3d.",
        "Pinned Akroma Oracle: paying the offered red activation increases only that source object's power by one. Changing control retains that object; departure and return creates a new object under CR 400.7, so an already-stacked modifier cannot affect it. Pre-action replay and pending save/load retain those distinctions.",
        "The family is bounded to represented Oracle clauses and does not claim aggregate Name rules coverage."
      ]
